      "factKind": "definition",
      "displayLabel": "定义 1",
      "shortTitle": "群",
      "title": "群的定义",
      "statement": "群是一个集合 G 连同二元运算 (x,y)↦xy，满足结合律，存在单位元 e，并且每个 x∈G 都存在逆元 x⁻¹。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#group"
    },
    {
      "id": "group:entry:subgroup",
      "entryClass": "fact",
      "factKind": "definition",
      "displayLabel": "定义 2",
      "shortTitle": "子群",
      "title": "子群的定义",
      "statement": "群 G 的非空子集 H 称为子群，如果对任意 x,y∈H 都有 xy⁻¹∈H；此时 H 在 G 的运算下自身构成群。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#subgroup"
    },
    {
      "id": "group:entry:left-coset",
      "entryClass": "fact",
      "factKind": "definition",
      "displayLabel": "定义 3",
      "shortTitle": "左陪集",
      "title": "左陪集的定义",
      "statement": "若 H≤G 且 g∈G，则 H 关于 g 的左陪集定义为 gH={gh∣h∈H}。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#left-coset"
    },
    {
      "id": "group:entry:order",
      "entryClass": "fact",
      "factKind": "definition",
      "displayLabel": "定义 4",
      "shortTitle": "群的阶",
      "title": "有限群和子群的阶",
      "statement": "有限集合 X 的基数记为 |X|；有限群 G 的阶是 |G|，有限子群 H 的阶是 |H|。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#order"
    },
    {
      "id": "group:entry:coset-partition",
      "entryClass": "claim",
      "claimKind": "lemma",
      "displayLabel": "引理 1",
      "shortTitle": "陪集分割",
      "title": "左陪集构成群的分割",
      "statement": "若 H≤G，则 H 的任意两个左陪集或者相等，或者不相交；所有左陪集的并等于 G。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#coset-partition"
    },
    {
      "id": "group:entry:coset-cardinality",
      "entryClass": "claim",
      "claimKind": "lemma",
      "displayLabel": "引理 2",
      "shortTitle": "陪集等势",
      "title": "每个左陪集与子群等势",
      "statement": "若 H≤G 且 g∈G，则映射 H→gH，h↦gh 是双射；特别地，当 H 有限时，|gH|=|H|。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#coset-cardinality"
    },
    {
      "id": "group:entry:lagrange",
      "entryClass": "claim",
      "claimKind": "theorem",
      "displayLabel": "定理 1",
      "shortTitle": "Lagrange 定理",
      "title": "有限群的 Lagrange 定理",
      "statement": "若 G 是有限群且 H≤G，则 |G|=[G:H]|H|；因此 |H| 整除 |G|。",
      "chapterIds": [
        "group:chapter:cosets"
      ],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/group-theory-project-view.json#lagrange"
    }
  ],
